{
  "description": "std-card-grid — a titled grid of content cards from a config list. Each card can carry an image (screenshots, portfolio, case studies), a portrait (team members), an icon, a badge, a title, a description and a link. `look` picks media cards, centered profile cards, or plain text cards. Pick for showcases, team pages, case studies, service catalogs and testimonials.",
